    (property "Note" "True reverse-blocking adjustable OV cutoff eFuse; PGTH senses own INPUT, not shared output. PoE overload latchoff; restart requires power removal. MP4583 PG holds UV through1k untilconvertergood;1u UVRC releaseshardwareafteroutputestablished. 10n100V/100ohm dVdt limits downstreambank charging; normalreverseblock/OCP/OV/OTP remain. PG low on converterfault dischargesUVcap; no firmware startup dependency. PG3 intentionally unused after removal of input-branch status comparators. Original PGTH4 divider remains. Actual UV/OV/current/reverse/default and converter-PG-to-UV interlocks unchanged; U21.PG is indication only, not a new inhibit authority." (id 5) (at 218.44 134.62 0)
